 Key responsibilities and challenges 
 Participate actively in drafting, reviewing and negotiating documentation;
 Provide research and advice to clients;
 Coordinate the input of lawyers from other jurisdictions to ensure that clients receive a seamless service from the firm;
 Work closely with other departments (cross-practice) and offices in other jurisdictions (cross-border matters).
